{"version":2,"slug":"understand-the-world-cup-in-english","videoId":"LS0atYSLYmw","videoUrl":"https://youtu.be/LS0atYSLYmw","lang":"en","title":"Understand the World Cup in English","category":"Daily life","channel":"Miss Honey 🍯","channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/@Slow_English_Podcast","captionSource":"auto","tags":["English Conversation","learn english"],"backUrl":"/","lines":[{"start":0,"text":"Hello."},{"start":1,"text":"And welcome back to my"},{"start":4,"text":"slow English podcast. Today,"},{"start":9,"text":"I want to talk about"},{"start":12,"text":"soccer."},{"start":14,"text":"The FIFA World Cup starts today."},{"start":19,"text":"So, let's learn some words that you need"},{"start":24,"text":"to know."},{"start":25,"text":"After watching this video,"},{"start":29,"text":"you'll want to watch the game"},{"start":33,"text":"in English"},{"start":35,"text":"to practice."},{"start":36,"text":"So,"},{"start":38,"text":"why"},{"start":39,"text":"is football"},{"start":41,"text":"the world's most popular sport?"},{"start":46,"text":"I think"},{"start":48,"text":"it's because everyone can play it."},{"start":52,"text":"You just need"},{"start":55,"text":"a soccer ball."},{"start":56,"text":"You don't need"},{"start":58,"text":"some fancy,"},{"start":60,"text":"expensive"},{"start":62,"text":"equipment"},{"start":64,"text":"or"},{"start":65,"text":"an experienced"},{"start":67,"text":"trainer"},{"start":69,"text":"to train you."},{"start":71,"text":"You just need"},{"start":73,"text":"your legs"},{"start":75,"text":"and some friends to play with."},{"start":78,"text":"I don't think"},{"start":80,"text":"that there's anything else"},{"start":83,"text":"that joins the world"},{"start":86,"text":"like FIFA does. Maybe the Olympics a"},{"start":91,"text":"little bit,"},{"start":94,"text":"but FIFA"},{"start":95,"text":"just makes people"},{"start":98,"text":"go crazy. I don't think the Olympics"},{"start":105,"text":"makes people"},{"start":107,"text":"go as crazy"},{"start":109,"text":"as FIFA World Cup does. What do you"},{"start":114,"text":"think? So,"},{"start":116,"text":"what happens at a soccer game?"},{"start":121,"text":"First,"},{"start":122,"text":"there are two teams. Your team"},{"start":128,"text":"and the opposing"},{"start":131,"text":"team."},{"start":132,"text":"Each team"},{"start":134,"text":"has"},{"start":136,"text":"a coach. [clears throat]"},{"start":137,"text":"The coach"},{"start":139,"text":"helps the teams improve"},{"start":143,"text":"and decide"},{"start":145,"text":"strategy."},{"start":147,"text":"The coach helps the team improve"},{"start":152,"text":"and decides the team's strategy."},{"start":157,"text":"There is also a referee."},{"start":161,"text":"Referee."},{"start":163,"text":"The one wearing stripes like me and"},{"start":167,"text":"he yells, \"Shh. Yellow card. Red card.\""},{"start":172,"text":"That's the referee."},{"start":174,"text":"The coach is like a teacher,"},{"start":178,"text":"but for soccer players."},{"start":181,"text":"The referee makes sure everyone follows"},{"start":187,"text":"the rules. And, of course,"},{"start":191,"text":"there are thousands of fans"},{"start":194,"text":"and supporters"},{"start":197,"text":"watching from"},{"start":200,"text":"the crowd"},{"start":201,"text":"or watching the match from"},{"start":206,"text":"their TVs."},{"start":208,"text":"The soccer match. Some fans paint their"},{"start":213,"text":"faces."},{"start":215,"text":"Some fans wear jerseys."},{"start":220,"text":"Some sing songs for their team."},{"start":223,"text":"Have you ever watched a soccer match?"},{"start":228,"text":"Who do you support?"},{"start":231,"text":"Now, let's talk about the players."},{"start":235,"text":"Every team has a goalie."},{"start":240,"text":"The goalie's job is simple. Don't let"},{"start":245,"text":"the ball"},{"start":246,"text":"go into the goal. When the goalie stops"},{"start":251,"text":"a shot,"},{"start":254,"text":"we call that"},{"start":256,"text":"a save."},{"start":258,"text":"He saved it."},{"start":260,"text":"Some players focus on defense."},{"start":265,"text":"Their job"},{"start":266,"text":"is to stop the opposing team from"},{"start":270,"text":"scoring a goal."},{"start":272,"text":"Other players focus on offense."},{"start":276,"text":"Their job is to create opportunities"},{"start":281,"text":"and also score goals."},{"start":284,"text":"But, the forwards"},{"start":287,"text":"play closest to the goal."},{"start":291,"text":"So, the forwards are usually the ones"},{"start":295,"text":"who score the most goals."},{"start":299,"text":"And behind them are the midfielders. So,"},{"start":304,"text":"what do players actually do during the"},{"start":308,"text":"game?"},{"start":309,"text":"They pass the ball"},{"start":312,"text":"to their teammates."},{"start":315,"text":"And when they have a good opportunity,"},{"start":319,"text":"they shoot."},{"start":321,"text":"Scoring a goal"},{"start":323,"text":"is the most exciting part"},{"start":326,"text":"of the game."},{"start":328,"text":"And the team that has the ball"},{"start":332,"text":"has possession. The teams, obviously,"},{"start":337,"text":"try to have possession"},{"start":340,"text":"as long as possible"},{"start":344,"text":"to not let the other team take"},{"start":347,"text":"possession."},{"start":349,"text":"Sometimes a defender"},{"start":351,"text":"makes a tackle."},{"start":353,"text":"A tackle is when one player tries to"},{"start":357,"text":"take away the ball from the opponent"},{"start":361,"text":"player."},{"start":362,"text":"But"},{"start":363,"text":"not every tackle"},{"start":367,"text":"is legal."},{"start":368,"text":"Sometimes players commit a foul."},{"start":374,"text":"When there's a foul"},{"start":376,"text":"the referee"},{"start":378,"text":"may stop the game and the other team may"},{"start":383,"text":"get a free kick."},{"start":387,"text":"Or"},{"start":388,"text":"if the foul happens near the goal"},{"start":393,"text":"they could have a penalty."},{"start":396,"text":"The penalty"},{"start":397,"text":"is one of the best chances to score."},{"start":401,"text":"And sometimes players"},{"start":404,"text":"argue"},{"start":406,"text":"with the referee."},{"start":409,"text":"If they play too aggressively"},{"start":413,"text":"the referee"},{"start":416,"text":"may give them a yellow card."},{"start":419,"text":"A yellow card"},{"start":422,"text":"is a warning."},{"start":424,"text":"But if a player is very aggressive"},{"start":429,"text":"or breaks a rule"},{"start":433,"text":"then they'll get a red card."},{"start":437,"text":"And then"},{"start":438,"text":"they must leave the game."},{"start":442,"text":"Imagine playing with one less player."},{"start":446,"text":"That must be very difficult."},{"start":449,"text":"So it's not good to get a red card."},{"start":454,"text":"Now what happens if a game"},{"start":457,"text":"is tied?"},{"start":460,"text":"Then"},{"start":461,"text":"they go"},{"start":462,"text":"extra time. But, the players are already"},{"start":468,"text":"[sighs]"},{"start":468.6,"text":"tired."},{"start":470,"text":"The fans are nervous. Everyone wants a"},{"start":475,"text":"winner."},{"start":476,"text":"But, of course, eventually one team"},{"start":480,"text":"scores or"},{"start":482,"text":"wins in penalties."},{"start":485,"text":"But, finally,"},{"start":487,"text":"the equipment"},{"start":488,"text":"is also"},{"start":490,"text":"simple."},{"start":491,"text":"Players wear cleats."},{"start":495,"text":"They help them run"},{"start":498,"text":"in the grass."},{"start":500,"text":"They also wear shin guards"},{"start":504,"text":"to protect their shins."},{"start":507,"text":"Have you ever been kicked"},{"start":511,"text":"on your shins before?"},{"start":514,"text":"It's painful."},{"start":517,"text":"So, shin guards are very important."},{"start":520,"text":"Then, they wear their jersey"},{"start":523,"text":"with their team's colors."},{"start":525,"text":"Behind the goalie"},{"start":528,"text":"is the goal net."},{"start":531,"text":"Most people just call it"},{"start":534,"text":"the goal."},{"start":535,"text":"And that's soccer."},{"start":537,"text":"[laughter]"},{"start":538,"text":"Simple to learn,"},{"start":541,"text":"exciting to watch, and loved around the"},{"start":546,"text":"world. Now, tell me,"},{"start":550,"text":"have you ever played soccer?"},{"start":553,"text":"What is your favorite team? And who do"},{"start":558,"text":"you think will win"},{"start":560,"text":"the World Cup? Comment below."},{"start":564,"text":"And I hope you enjoyed this bonus video"},{"start":569,"text":"of the week."},{"start":570,"text":"And of course, like this video if you"},{"start":573,"text":"did."},{"start":574,"text":"And subscribe to learn English with me"},{"start":578,"text":"every week."},{"start":580,"text":"And remember,"},{"start":582,"text":"never stop learning."},{"start":585,"text":"See you next week. Bye."},{"start":594,"text":"[music]"}]}